@115888 I’m really sorry to hear about the mix‑up with the three accounts – that does sound frustrating! The best way to sort this out is to verify the ownership of the accounts and then either merge them or close the duplicates. If you (or your auntie) can let us know the email addresses or usernames tied to each of the accounts, we can start the verification process.  

In the meantime, you can try resetting the password for each account (using the “Forgot password?” link on the login screen) – that often gets you back in quickly. Once you’ve regained access to at least one of them, we can look at consolidating the others so you only have a single, working account.  

If you run into any roadblocks, just reply here with the details and we’ll keep helping you step‑by‑step. Thanks for your patience!

